terface-guidelines/toggles#iOS-iPadOS","line":27},{"title":"An illustration of two list rows, one with an active switch toggle and one with an inactive switch toggle. The active toggle is tinted green with the standard switch color.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/95dd06ef1de5bf4360caef804af79b15/toggles-ios-default-color%402x.png","line":33,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of two list rows, one with an active switch toggle and one with an inactive switch toggle. The active toggle is tinted purple with a custom switch color.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8e40963d32263c9319f4b5f3ac3ac721/toggles-ios-custom-color%402x.png","line":35,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the top half of the Phone app on iPhone, showing the filtered list of recent missed calls. The filter button in the top trailing corner has a blue highlight, indicating that the toggle is active.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/895b4c8fd67287f587d7c0576c2555a8/toggles-ios-phone-filter-on%402x.png","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the top half of the Phone app on iPhone, showing all recent calls. The filter button in the top trailing corner has no highlight, indicating that the toggle is inactive.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d38180341155877eec2f5b34159ab72f/toggles-ios-phone-filter-off%402x.png","line":43,"embedded":true},{"title":"`changesSelectionAsPrimaryAction`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UIButton/changesSelectionAsPrimaryAction","line":47},{"title":"macOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/toggles#macOS","line":49},{"title":"Switches","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/toggles#Switches","line":55},{"title":"`switch`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/ToggleStyle/switch","line":57},{"title":"`ControlSize`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/ControlSize","line":59},{"title":"`GroupedFormStyle`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/GroupedFormStyle","line":59},{"title":"Checkboxes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/toggles#Checkboxes","line":63},{"title":"An illustration showing a layout that includes two levels of checkboxes.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ec2755eb8089e275b1ebb3cd294606b0/checkbox-alignment%402x.png","line":69,"embedded":true},{"title":"`allowsMixedState`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSButton/allowsMixedState","line":75},{"title":"An illustration that shows a checkbox with the on state, which looks like a small rounded square with blue fill and a white checkmark.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/67efc6dab34453404f164acef3bac84d/checkbox-selected%402x.png","line":77,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that shows a checkbox with the off state, which looks like a small rounded square with no fill.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/ffd72e78175dc69a27016e8454030b71/checkbox-deselected%402x.png","line":79,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that shows a checkbox with the mixed state, which looks like a small rounded square with blue fill and a white hyphen.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/f60cc3ddbea31509d83e204d963cb1d0/checkbox-mixed%402x.png","line":81,"embedded":true},{"title":"Radio buttons","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/toggles#Radio-buttons","line":83},{"title":"An illustration that shows five items in a column, each with a radio button preceding the text Radio Button Label. The radio button for the third item is filled, indicating that it's selected.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/dee18caa44a87ddcad53b912203b2fea/radio-button-example%402x.png","line":87,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that shows a selected radio button, which looks like a white dot centered in a small circle with a dark fill.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/91c45b3934ecd18b42b2bb72e64ca702/radio-button-selected%402x.png","line":91,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration that shows a deselected radio button, which looks like a small, empty circle.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/1bec25f63381d81a41f885e1338eb571/radio-button-deselected%402x.png","line":93,"embedded":true},{"title":"pop-up button","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/pop-up-buttons","line":97},{"title":"An illustration that shows three items in a row, with a radio button preceding each item. The first and third items have long text labels, while the second has a short label. The horizontal space each item occupies is equal. A filled radio button precedes the second item, indicating that it's selected.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/95fc61aefa156d2d78d9eb6589a47f6e/radio-button-equal-spacing%402x.png","line":103,"embedded":true},{"title":"Resources","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/toggles#Resources","line":105},{"title":"Related","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/toggles#Related","line":107},{"title":"Layout","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/layout","line":109},{"title":"Developer documentation","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/toggles#Developer-documentation","line":111},{"title":"`Toggle`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/Toggle","line":113},{"title":"`UISwitch`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/UIKit/UISwitch","line":115},{"title":"`NSButton.ButtonType.toggle`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSButton/ButtonType/toggle","line":117},{"title":"`NSSwitch`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AppKit/NSSwitch","line":119},{"title":"Change log","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/toggles#Change-log","line":121}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ai stuff/antigravity-awesome-skills-main/skills/hig-components-controls/references/toggles.md"},
